[TITLE]
SIM-14: pressure-driven demand in kPa with a 0.2 kPa pressure range
Demand falls from full at 20.2 kPa to zero at 20 kPa. Reservoir R1 (12 m) cannot
supply the full 150 L/s, so the junctions settle inside that narrow range.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     50        ; L/s
 J2   0     50
 J3   0     50

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   12

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  500     150   100    0      Open
 P2  J1  J2  500     100   100    0      Open
 P3  J2  J3  500     100   100    0      Open

[OPTIONS]
 Units              LPS
 Headloss           H-W
 Pressure           KPA
 Demand Model       PDA
 Minimum Pressure   20      ; kPa
 Required Pressure  20.2    ; kPa: 0.2 kPa = 0.067 ft above the minimum
 Pressure Exponent  0.5
 Unbalanced         Continue 10

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[REPORT]
 Status   Yes
 Summary  No

[END]
